{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44939","headline":"荅豆卢次方 · 皎然","name":"荅豆卢次方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱道交论，爲高贵世名。\n昔称柴桑令，今闻豆卢生。\n彼生清淮气，独锺文中彩。\n近作公讌诗，如逢何柳在。\n吾用古人耳，采君四坐珍。\n贤士胜朝晖，温温无冬春。\n朝晖烁我肌，贤士清我神。\n微尔与云鹄，幽怀何由申。\n别来秋风至，独坐楚山碧。\n高月当清冥，禅心正寂历。\n增波徒相骇，人远情不隔。\n有书遗琼什，以代貂襜褕。\n风教凌越绝，声名掩吴趋。\n悬璧安可酬，徙倚还踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}